        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom terraced property to the market at No. 6 Meadow Views, Sarsfield Road, Kilmainham, Dublin 10.\nNo. 6 Meadow Views is a spacious and beautifully presented family home which comes to the market in great condition throughout. Boasting generous proportions, an excellent internal layout and a fantastic location, this impressive property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and investors alike. A further standout feature is the attic conversion, providing valuable additional space and excellent versatility for a variety of uses.\nThe location is second to none, with Sarsfield Road and the surrounding Kilmainham area offering an abundance of amenities right on the doorstep. Residents can enjoy a wide selection of local shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, parks and sporting facilities, while Kilmainham Gaol, IMMA and the Phoenix Park are all within easy reach. Excellent transport links provide swift access to Dublin City Centre, with the Luas, bus routes and major road networks all easily accessible.\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation consisting of c. 117sqm of internal floorspace comprises of, an entrance hallway, spacious living room leading into a gorgeous open-plan kitchen and dining area. Upstairs hosts three generous bedrooms and a main family bathroom, while the converted attic provides further valuable floorspace. The property has been exceptionally well maintained and is presented in excellent decorative order throughout, allowing the new owner to move straight in with little to no work required.\nFurther benefits include triple-glazed windows to the front, generous bedroom accommodation, a superb open-plan living/dining space and the added versatility of the converted attic. The combination of spacious accommodation, quality presentation and practical additional space makes this an ideal home for modern family living.\nSure to generate strong interest from a wide range of buyers, this superb home combines generous living accommodation with a highly convenient location and excellent turnkey presentation. Early viewing is highly advised please contact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today to arrange a viewing.\n________________________________________\nFeatures\n• 3 bed / 2 bath terraced\n• C. 117 sqm of internal floorspace\n• BER B\n• Gorgeous open-plan living/dining area\n• Converted attic providing valuable additional space\n• Triple-glazed windows to the front\n• Three generous bedrooms\n• Excellent internal layout\n• Highly sought-after Kilmainham location\n• Close to a wealth of local amenities\n• Excellent transport links to Dublin City Centre\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, families and investors\nDirections \nEircode D10 WV59"
      },
